        {
          "id": 817801816,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Also, if you look at any of the other IEs which contain the NSAPI, there's only one octet allocated for it (with the upper nibble spare). (7.7.22, 7.7.101, 7.7.104, 7.7.113, 7.7.115, etc.) And even an Enhanced NSAPI (7.7.67) is only in the range 128...255 and takes one octet. So I am very certain it's a typo.",
